exercises.instructions:
Write a function called `findByTitle` that takes an array of movie objects and a title string, and returns the matching movie object. If no movie matches, return `undefined`.

Example:
```
findByTitle(movies, "The Codfather")
// Returns: { id: 2, title: "The Codfather", year: 1972, ... }
```

exercises.starterCode:
// Find and return a movie object by its title
function findByTitle(movies, title) {

}

exercises.solution:
function findByTitle(movies, title) {
  return movies.find(movie => movie.title === title);
}

